<title>USA: Mexico's TV Azteca to sell $255 mln in 5-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TV Azteca to sell $255 mln in 5-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>TV Azteca, Mexico's second largest broadcaster, plans to sell $255 million senior secured five-year notes via Bear Stearns over the next few weeks, market sources said Wednesday.</p>
</text>
